// Attempt 2 — correct column name, but NO threshold. This is the query that was
// embedded in the first Data Activator rule (NoShow_Inv_Alert) and produced
// 15 Teams messages in under 10 minutes — the alert-fatigue lesson.
// Matches screenshot 08 (rule configuration) and 11 (the resulting spam).
// Source: BusTelemetry (Eventhouse: DetectiveAgency, live Eventstream)

BusTelemetry
| extend Delay = Timestamp - ScheduleTime
| summarize MaxDelay = max(Delay) by BusLine
| top 5 by MaxDelay desc
